From: Amphoze <184834775+Amphoze@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:23:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] secrets: no JWT secret and no key in a settings response

The settings, configuration and PostgREST configuration routes answered a JWT
secret, and upstream's published default when the process had none; the
settings and the project API props answered the process's API keys. The server
holds no JWT secret: the member is gone from the three answers, with the
constant and its default. The settings name the two keys and answer neither;
the props carry no key.
